  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY拼插城堡帐篷积木套装",
    "en": "DIY Fort Castle Building Block Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向7-14岁儿童的DIY拼插城堡帐篷积木套装，采用PP材质与大颗粒结构，强调拼装、搭建和脑力开发等互动玩法。\n\n品牌为LONDY，支持多场景拼插组合，适用于家庭互动、兴趣活动与课程化益智训练。",
    "en": "This is a DIY fort-and-castle building block set for children aged 7-14. It uses PP material and a large-block structure, focusing on assembly play, building interaction, and cognitive development activities.\n\nBrand: LONDY. The set supports multiple build combinations and is suitable for family interaction, hobby sessions, and structured educational play."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY拼插城堡帐篷积木套装以大颗粒拼插结构为核心，支持多种形态搭建。孩子可围绕城堡、帐篷与通道主题进行自由组合，形成连续的创意构建体验。",
      "产品面向7-14岁儿童，玩法覆盖拼装、组装、拼插与益智训练。可用于家庭互动、兴趣课程和团队协作活动，帮助提升空间认知与动手能力。",
      "包装采用彩盒，配套多尺寸杆件与连接球，便于做标准化出货和渠道陈列。适合常规零售及活动场景使用。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY fort-and-castle building set uses a large interlocking block structure and supports multiple build forms. Children can freely create castle, tent, and tunnel themes for continuous creative construction play.",
      "Designed for ages 7-14, the play modes include assembly, interlocking, and educational building activities. It fits family interaction, hobby classes, and team-based activities, helping improve spatial understanding and hands-on skills.",
      "The product is packed in a color box and includes rods in multiple sizes with connector balls, which supports standardized shipping and channel display. It is suitable for both regular retail and event-based play scenarios."
    ]
  },
